{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.poster.avif?t=1756368755\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.webm?t=1756368755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mate with an alien queen, or kill her. Become a cosmic entity, talk to a stone to discover the secrets of the universe, become a space pirate or a parasite-infected horror. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drift through cold, unforgiving space, stranded far from Earth and desperate to return home. Strange worlds lie before you, each ripe with secrets and cosmic dread. Mystery haunts every alien landscape and forgotten starship, where even the silence feels alive and foreboding. Driven by the hope of reuniting with your daughter back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.poster.avif?t=1756368755\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.webm?t=1756368755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Robust RPG mechanics: level-up progression, turn-based combat, inventory management, bartering, skill checks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A soundtrack 100% made by humans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand-crafted illustrations (also completely human-made)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich story packed with smart or absurd choices that will get you killed in interesting ways (last time I checked, AI couldn't crack a joke).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886120?t=1756368755","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886120?t=1756368755","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/1210f9797775a0e0646e2ab5f41d2b0a70683c05/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756368755","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/1210f9797775a0e0646e2ab5f41d2b0a70683c05/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756368755","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"'A space accident' is not a horror game but has some 'cosmic horror' elements, and it is not intended for children or those easily disturbed. You can also mate with an alien, although there is no graphics. And maybe we should mention the parasite... wait, that's too much of a spoiler. \r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3949010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.poster.avif?t=1756368755\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.webm?t=1756368755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mate with an alien queen, or kill her. Become a cosmic entity, talk to a stone to discover the secrets of the universe, become a space pirate or a parasite-infected horror. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drift through cold, unforgiving space, stranded far from Earth and desperate to return home. Strange worlds lie before you, each ripe with secrets and cosmic dread. Mystery haunts every alien landscape and forgotten starship, where even the silence feels alive and foreboding. Driven by the hope of reuniting with your daughter back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.poster.avif?t=1756368755\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.webm?t=1756368755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Robust RPG mechanics: level-up progression, turn-based combat, inventory management, bartering, skill checks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A soundtrack 100% made by humans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand-crafted illustrations (also completely human-made)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich story packed with smart or absurd choices that will get you killed in interesting ways (last time I checked, AI couldn't crack a joke).</p>","developers":["Pick Your Universe"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/0aed2ad515ac3083654a718c99fd8bba1ca3e4ba/header.jpg?t=1756368755","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/